  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO - Norway framework agreement for Tunisia. The framework agreement consists of three parts: Vocational training, formalization of the economy, and job creation with focus on women and youth in less favoured regions in Tunisia.</narrative>
